    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 43,
        "text": "Hi, Ben. You look tired. Are you okay?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "2fa7acb0f54584068df6982b3874bec5880bac7dff47c17d13c18c25d9a060aa",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 49,
        "sourceEnd": 122,
        "text": "Yeah, I'm fine. I just didn't sleep well. I have too much work this week.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "e0fa173169d14262a46d2a218a15f7822e3eac179b3a9d46e4619dbae6376c2d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 128,
        "sourceEnd": 207,
        "text": "That's not good. You should take a break. How many hours do you work every day?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "62b404f36f962d21509b1b5b13f64f8dffd3fd5934665cc095c3ba75b2320b2e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 213,
        "sourceEnd": 293,
        "text": "About ten hours. I know I should not work so much. But I have many things to do.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "47d05c0ff4c49bc4017feda970a666a14d5fe333746af7f5c1b23872a16c3aa2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 299,
        "sourceEnd": 329,
        "text": "Do you have time to eat lunch?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "36ca28fd388b04f65fdac91320049f86ce37b8790e57dcc01284910a26400bfb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 335,
        "sourceEnd": 435,
        "text": "Not really. I usually eat a little bread and drink a little coffee. Sometimes I have a few biscuits.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "4a70f8e48cb725fa01739d5fd4c4d18a722850eb2e1b9b8655fef2a32cc7db83",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 441,
        "sourceEnd": 533,
        "text": "That's not healthy. You should eat more vegetables and fruit. You should not eat only bread.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "d301f6204bb8ae17822ea21c2fa922ca4b4df9a0a7a437d35a7181ec1fdf4bd7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 539,
        "sourceEnd": 641,
        "text": "I know. But I don't have much time to cook. I have a few minutes in the morning, so I just make toast.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "b022da5c919a578e7c974905ccde311440aa90eba77301a05039916e98e2ccfa",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 647,
        "sourceEnd": 779,
        "text": "You can prepare food the night before. I make a little salad and put it in the fridge. Then I have a few healthy snacks for the day.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "d0f8f196739ef1e95e76e5806d450cbb7d88f19a402785a4cbf0499be58b6b26",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 785,
        "sourceEnd": 833,
        "text": "That's a good idea. How much water do you drink?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "8502863504cab099a042d167041019ada186f842aedc484dea1428ed255dbc4e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 839,
        "sourceEnd": 920,
        "text": "I drink a lot of water. Maybe two litres a day. You should drink more water, too.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "501066d496d64a1916b927d823f9505c38efba160108be6048d774b6973868e6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 926,
        "sourceEnd": 1001,
        "text": "You're right. I drink a little water, maybe one glass. I should drink more.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "658ddcd94a6b3565c06c116e76e253018c9147f8d9d01e16df334a25ca0837c7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1007,
        "sourceEnd": 1074,
        "text": "And you should not drink so much coffee. How many cups do you have?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "df7e46d8755c1c8382801098b8df667ef67499ab8ea79144b609ace00572fa58",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1080,
        "sourceEnd": 1128,
        "text": "I have three or four cups. I know it's too many.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "d84989c6424571709afbbeb18aaeb356ff277acbdd03e748d1e6e80967bc4d86",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1134,
        "sourceEnd": 1219,
        "text": "Try to have a few cups, not four. And you should eat a little fruit in the afternoon.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "ab24036ed1a6c90cc2af1c858e990a0d26adddace190431f759ae9bfc67c4577",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1225,
        "sourceEnd": 1263,
        "text": "Okay. I'll try. Thanks for the advice.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "bab274f917b9a968c19bebfe67226ac7a0b15bab474622be2dc0f4ec380ed954",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1269,
        "sourceEnd": 1348,
        "text": "No problem. Let's get lunch together tomorrow. We can have a lot of vegetables.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "ec9d11b34c8b924edc0d22a2e05f764b9e345881d1a1eabe960b9890832e28da",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1354,
        "sourceEnd": 1396,
        "text": "Sounds good. I should make better choices.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "131408d51681cf5d3973b6a9f7a7b369685f19d088ce152eb0ad66357469fc58",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
